        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14939\">issue #14939</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This test:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unwind</span>\n<span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unwind_info</span>\n<span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aarch64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">pc</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">windows</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">msvc</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preserve_all</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">fn0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">block0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nc\">call</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fn0</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cranelift</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">tools</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preserve</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clif</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">thread</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">worker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"n\">N</span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">panicked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cranelift</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">codegen</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">isa</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">unwind</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">winarm64</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rs</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">263</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">33</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"nc\">Can</span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">save</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">registers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X19</span>\n<span class=\"n\">FAIL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preserve</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clif</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">panicked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">worker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"n\">N</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Can</span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">save</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">registers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X19</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tests</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This module:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"wasm\"><pre><span></span><code>(module\n  (type $t (func (param i32) (result i32)))\n  (table funcref (elem $g))\n  (func $g (type $t) local.get 0 i32.const 1 i32.add)\n  (func (export \"f\") (param i32) (result i32)\n    local.get 0\n    i32.const 0\n    return_call_indirect (type $t)))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with guest debugging enabled:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">arch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aarch64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">pc</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">windows</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">msvc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">guest</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">debug</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">retcall_ind</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">thread</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">unnamed</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">panicked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cranelift</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">codegen</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">isa</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">unwind</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">winarm64</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rs</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">263</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">33</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"nc\">Can</span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">save</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">registers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X19</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Without guest debugging it compiles, but its unwind info is wrong:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">arch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aarch64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">pc</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">windows</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">msvc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">retcall_ind</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aarch64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">linux</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">gnu</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">objdump</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">retcall_ind</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cwasm</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">0000000000000020</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]::</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"nc\">a9bf7bfd</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">stp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x29</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">!</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"mi\">910003</span><span class=\"n\">fd</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mov</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x29</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">28</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"nc\">f8408050</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ldur</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">x16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">x2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"nc\">f8418210</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ldur</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">x16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">x16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"mi\">91008210</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"mh\">0x20</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">34</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"nc\">eb3063ff</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cmp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x16</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">38</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"mi\">54000363</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cc</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">a4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]::</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mh\">0x84</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"nc\">a9bf6bf3</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">stp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x19</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x26</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">sp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">!</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aarch64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">linux</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">gnu</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">objcopy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">O</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binary</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">section</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">xdata</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">retcall_ind</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cwasm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">retcall_ind</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">xdata</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xxd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">g1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">retcall_ind</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">xdata</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">00000000</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">05</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">81</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">23</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">01</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">81</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">........</span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"o\">......</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">00000010</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">01</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">da</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">01</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">da</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">81</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">db</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">01</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">db</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">81</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">01</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cc</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">............</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The <code>.xdata</code> entry for <code>function[1]</code> is at offset 0x8, and its unwind codes<br>\nare <code>cc 01 e1 81</code>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>cc 01</code> is <code>save_regp_x x19, x20, [sp, #-16]!</code>, but the prologue saves <code>x19, x26</code>.</li>\n<li>There's no <code>end</code> (<code>e4</code>) code. The next function's header (<code>3a 00 00 30</code>) follows immediately.</li>\n<li>The stack-limit check at 0x28-0x38 has no codes, so the codes don't map one-to-one to prologue instructions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;details&gt;<br>\n&lt;summary&gt;LLM summary, if helpful&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p>All three are in <code>cranelift/codegen/src/isa/unwind/winarm64.rs</code>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong><code>preserve_all</code> panic:</strong> Windows arm64 unwind codes can only describe<br>\n  saves of x19-x28 and d8-d15 (short of <code>save_any_xreg</code>), and<br>\n<code>create_unwind_info</code> panics on anything else. <code>preserve_all</code> saves<br>\n  x0-x17 too, and Wasmtime uses it for the guest-debug breakpoint<br>\n  trampoline.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Non-consecutive pair:</strong> the prologue saves callee-saved registers two<br>\n  at a time in sorted order, and regalloc2 doesn't hand them out<br>\n  consecutively, so <code>stp x19, x26</code> happens. The two <code>SaveReg</code> records are<br>\n  merged into one <code>save_regp_x</code>, which can only express x(N), x(N+1), and<br>\n  the second register is dropped. An SEH unwinder would restore x20 from<br>\n  x26's slot and leave x26 alone.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>No <code>end</code> code / not one-to-one:</strong> <code>emit</code> writes only the prologue<br>\n  codes, never <code>end</code>, and no <code>nop</code> codes for prologue instructions that<br>\n  don't change unwind state (<code>bti c</code>, the stack-limit check, the tail-call<br>\n  frame move, multi-instruction SP adjustments). The format requires both<br>\n  for unwinding from inside a prologue. Wasmtime's own unwinding uses<br>\n  frame pointers, so this affects only SEH-based tools (debuggers, ETW,<br>\n<code>RtlVirtualUnwind</code>). None of this was tested on Windows.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt;<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
